  _headline: "Desvio de verba vem a p\xFAblico"
  _headlineEn: Diversion of public funds comes to light
  _body: "O dinheiro que sumiu faria falta nos servi\xE7os, e a confian\xE7a sumiu
    junto. O cofre, desta vez, n\xE3o ecoou: ficou mudo."
  _bodyEn: The missing money was meant for services, and trust went with it. This
    time the vault didn't echo; it said nothing.
